     8| * Runs independently of the Rork browser. It needs:
     9| *   - SUPABASE_URL + SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY (task queue + proof ledger)
    10| *   - GITHUB_TOKEN + GITHUB_REPO_URL (read files, commit changes)
    11| *   - RENDER_API_KEY + RENDER_SERVICE_ID (deploy, poll)
    12| *   - OPENAI_API_KEY or AI_GATEWAY_API_KEY (AI reasoning for planning + code gen)
